WEBVTT

00:00:02.005 --> 00:00:05.805
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:10.077
Delivers this message

00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:19.080
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.223 --> 00:00:20.690
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:28.798
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:29.093
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.332 --> 00:00:36.602
We feel weak at the knees a
little, gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.839 --> 00:00:40.969
But please don't look back

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:45.137
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.348 --> 00:00:49.444
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.719 --> 00:00:53.155
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.423 --> 00:00:57.325
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.727 --> 00:01:01.390
Delivers this message

00:01:01.831 --> 00:01:10.000
I will watch over you as you
go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.373 --> 00:01:18.576
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.015 --> 00:01:28.686
Fly forth strongly with
the wings of freedom

00:01:32.662 --> 00:01:34.596
Morning had not yet fully broken.

00:01:34.664 --> 00:01:36.632
Having received word that Koren...

00:01:36.699 --> 00:01:39.167
...the capital of Sa Province,
was under complete blockade...

00:01:39.502 --> 00:01:42.562
...Shurei's party was forced
to depart from Kinka.

00:01:43.606 --> 00:01:47.201
They will try to enter the
blockaded city of Koren.

00:01:48.978 --> 00:01:50.206
Official Yu.

00:01:50.279 --> 00:01:51.439
What is it?

00:01:51.714 --> 00:01:55.115
Well, could you please
apologize to Korin for me?

00:01:55.818 --> 00:01:58.184
Tell her that I'm sorry for
leaving without saying anything.

00:01:58.254 --> 00:02:00.654
When she finds out we left
leaving only her behind...

00:02:01.057 --> 00:02:02.524
I wouldn't worry about it.

00:02:02.592 --> 00:02:04.560
I'm sure she understands perfectly...

00:02:04.894 --> 00:02:06.862
...how dangerous this
journey will be...

00:02:06.929 --> 00:02:09.363
...and that she would
only be a burden to you.

00:02:10.566 --> 00:02:12.534
He's right.

00:02:14.103 --> 00:02:16.071
Please take care.

00:02:16.472 --> 00:02:18.406
Yes. We'll be going.

00:02:18.474 --> 00:02:20.442
You take care of the rest here.

00:02:22.378 --> 00:02:27.338
1000 Years' Worth of
Thoughts in a Single Day

00:02:35.658 --> 00:02:37.751
Governor Hong!

00:02:43.766 --> 00:02:45.131
Father?

00:02:45.401 --> 00:02:46.959
Ensei, stop.

00:02:48.638 --> 00:02:52.699
What did you say? You're
taking only my son with you?

00:02:53.209 --> 00:02:56.906
Yes. Mr. Sai knows the
route to Koren very well...

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.573
...and we're hoping not
to get into any battles...

00:02:59.649 --> 00:03:02.083
...so it would be best not to
take any soldiers with us.

00:03:02.952 --> 00:03:04.943
I'm very honored, but to put it bluntly...

00:03:05.021 --> 00:03:07.751
...my son will be of no help as
your bodyguard.

00:03:08.224 --> 00:03:11.193
He's stingy with money,
and when most needed...

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:14.229
...he may very well leave the battlefield
rather than act as your shield!

00:03:15.064 --> 00:03:18.500
Good for you, Father. You
know your son very well.

00:03:19.135 --> 00:03:21.296
That's precisely the quality
that every merchant should have.

00:03:21.471 --> 00:03:23.439
I wasn't complimenting you!

00:03:25.274 --> 00:03:27.708
Well, the sun has risen.
Let's hurry and get going.

00:03:28.578 --> 00:03:31.138
It normally takes at least
five days to reach Koren...

00:03:31.647 --> 00:03:34.115
...but we must try to
arrive as soon as possible.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:36.650
You're right. Each day we're delayed...

00:03:36.919 --> 00:03:40.320
...the worse the conditions will
likely become within blockaded Koren.

00:03:40.756 --> 00:03:42.747
Like they say, "Time is money."

00:03:43.593 --> 00:03:46.061
You're always working
the abacus, aren't you?

00:03:46.729 --> 00:03:48.993
I'll take that as a compliment too.

00:03:59.308 --> 00:04:02.402
Shurei and her team
have departed for Koren.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:06.448
What they didn't know was
at about this time...

00:04:06.516 --> 00:04:08.950
...Ryuki's party was headed for Kinka.

00:04:16.893 --> 00:04:18.690
We've finally made it here.

00:04:18.861 --> 00:04:19.452
Right.

00:04:20.196 --> 00:04:23.029
Here? Well, where exactly is here?!

00:04:23.332 --> 00:04:24.629
We're in Sa Province.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:25.928
I know that much!

00:04:26.202 --> 00:04:27.169
You being directionally challenged...

00:04:27.236 --> 00:04:29.397
...could prove to be fatal
on a journey like this.

00:04:29.839 --> 00:04:32.307
If you get lost from the group,
we'll likely never see you again.

00:04:33.442 --> 00:04:35.910
Ryuki and his party had
departed from Kiyo...

00:04:36.012 --> 00:04:38.947
...and even cut back on sleep to get
further along a wild animal trail.

00:04:39.148 --> 00:04:41.810
They will be arriving
in Kinka before long.

00:04:43.419 --> 00:04:45.387
That's where Shurei is.

00:04:46.822 --> 00:04:48.790
We'll be there in the morning.

00:04:49.659 --> 00:04:50.990
I must apologize to you two...

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:54.427
...for making you travel
treacherous mountain paths...

00:04:55.064 --> 00:04:57.794
...that people don't usually use, and for
having sacrificed sleep to get further.

00:04:57.867 --> 00:04:59.664
All for my personal desire.

00:05:00.536 --> 00:05:04.199
Normally, as king, I should
not be leaving Kiyo at all.

00:05:05.241 --> 00:05:08.210
You didn't come here just for
personal feelings alone, did you?

00:05:09.679 --> 00:05:13.012
As king, you wanted to survey Sa
Province with your own eyes, didn't you?

00:05:13.349 --> 00:05:16.944
As the king, you definitely must
not interfere in this situation.

00:05:17.453 --> 00:05:19.421
You do understand that much.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:22.658
Of course. I do not
intend to help them.

00:05:23.159 --> 00:05:25.627
If Shurei and Eigetsu can't
overcome this on their own...

00:05:26.162 --> 00:05:28.630
...then it was meaningless
to send them to Sa Province.

00:05:29.031 --> 00:05:32.626
All I can do is... watch over them.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:45.374
But at this rate, we and our
horses won't make it much further.

00:05:46.549 --> 00:05:48.517
I suggest we rest until morning.

00:05:48.584 --> 00:05:50.108
G-Good idea.

00:05:57.426 --> 00:05:58.256
Here you are.

00:05:58.561 --> 00:05:59.892
Thank you, Korin.

00:06:01.864 --> 00:06:03.957
I wonder if Shurei is okay.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.697
Korin.

00:06:06.902 --> 00:06:12.397
I know. I'd only have been a burden
if I had gone with them. But...

00:06:13.576 --> 00:06:18.070
I would've at least liked to have seen
them off with a, "Have a safe trip."

00:06:19.382 --> 00:06:23.443
Don't worry. Governor Hong will
surely arrive in Koren safely...

00:06:23.986 --> 00:06:28.013
...and attend her appointment
ceremony. And so will Governor To.

00:06:28.591 --> 00:06:31.754
I-I'm saying that I'm
worried about Shurei!

00:06:35.898 --> 00:06:38.594
I'm sure Governor
Hong will be safe...

00:06:39.502 --> 00:06:40.969
...but the rest of them
are just nuisances...

00:06:41.037 --> 00:06:42.470
...as far as the Sa
Clan are concerned.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:47.601
I wonder if they'll all
reach Koren successfully.

00:06:50.713 --> 00:06:51.941
It's them.

00:06:52.014 --> 00:06:55.575
We are not to kill the daughter of the
Hong Clan. We're to capture her alive.

00:06:56.318 --> 00:06:57.285
And the rest?

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.718
They'll be eaten by
wolves right here!

00:07:00.189 --> 00:07:02.157
You're the ones who
are gonna be eaten.

00:07:11.233 --> 00:07:14.964
Delicious. Did you make this rice
and bean ball, Governor Hong?

00:07:15.471 --> 00:07:16.597
Yes.

00:07:16.672 --> 00:07:19.766
It's stuffed with lots of barbecued
pork, so it's really scrumptious!

00:07:22.344 --> 00:07:24.312
I'm sure this will sell.

00:07:25.214 --> 00:07:29.617
Mr. Sho Sai, you're truly always
thinking about business, aren't you?

00:07:30.052 --> 00:07:33.021
To the extent that I have an urge
to get back to Kinka to sell these.

00:07:33.522 --> 00:07:37.219
But if you do that, it'll only get you
into a quarrel with your father again.

00:07:37.793 --> 00:07:40.261
That father-son argument you
had this morning was a fun one.

00:07:40.629 --> 00:07:42.859
Especially compared to the
fights the Sa Clan get into.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.362
Welcome back!

00:07:45.534 --> 00:07:47.024
Just as we expected...

00:07:47.103 --> 00:07:49.128
...those men from the Sa Clan's
private army were wandering about.

00:07:49.438 --> 00:07:51.668
They were waiting for
nightfall to attack us.

00:07:51.741 --> 00:07:53.208
Thank you.

00:07:53.809 --> 00:07:57.939
Is Kokujun going to be all right?
Facing Chusho Sa all on his own.

00:07:59.281 --> 00:08:01.943
I wonder if he'll succeed in
putting a stop to that man's plot.

00:08:03.319 --> 00:08:06.152
Princess. Shall I tell you
something you don't know?

00:08:06.722 --> 00:08:07.620
What is it?

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.658
When things started getting messy...

00:08:09.725 --> 00:08:12.057
...within the Sa Clan following
old man Enjun's death...

00:08:12.128 --> 00:08:14.596
...the first thing he did was set
off for the Sa Clan residence.

00:08:15.397 --> 00:08:17.524
And Kokujun made
his opinion known...

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.933
...that the full authority of the
Sa Clan should go to old Lady Eiki.

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:23.438
Kokujun said that?

00:08:23.739 --> 00:08:26.572
But no one would listen
to Kokujun's opinion.

00:08:26.842 --> 00:08:28.810
Still, he felt the need to do something...

00:08:29.545 --> 00:08:32.013
...and came to me while I
was trapped in a dungeon.

00:08:35.451 --> 00:08:39.387
Kokujun is someone who has that one
thing that is most precious to him.

00:08:40.456 --> 00:08:43.050
In any case, no one other than
a member of the Sa Clan...

00:08:43.359 --> 00:08:46.055
...can solve the
problems of the Sa Clan.

00:08:48.664 --> 00:08:50.632
He has tasks that only he can do...

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:53.796
...and My Lady, you have
tasks that only you can do.

00:08:54.637 --> 00:08:57.731
But the time will come
when your paths will meet.

00:08:58.808 --> 00:09:02.335
And when that time comes, you will
make every effort to help him.

00:09:04.246 --> 00:09:06.214
You're right.

00:09:18.694 --> 00:09:23.324
When we get to Koren, I
will meet up with that man.

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:36.037
My Lady.

00:09:36.111 --> 00:09:38.102
Seiran, could I have some water?

00:09:47.456 --> 00:09:49.390
When I was little, whenever
I was unable to sleep...

00:09:50.626 --> 00:09:53.288
...mother would often tell me stories.

00:09:55.097 --> 00:09:56.724
I remember that.

00:09:56.799 --> 00:10:00.929
My favorite was that one
story..."The Rose Princess".

00:10:24.126 --> 00:10:25.491
Damn it.

00:10:25.561 --> 00:10:26.653
Not only is he
directionally challenged...

00:10:26.729 --> 00:10:29.391
...but he tosses and
turns in his sleep too!

00:10:36.238 --> 00:10:38.206
Your Majesty.

00:10:40.576 --> 00:10:42.510
I was watching the stars.

00:10:42.578 --> 00:10:45.103
You're body's not gonna be able to
take it unless you get some sleep.

00:10:45.781 --> 00:10:48.511
We're driving the horses on
as soon as the sky lightens.

00:10:51.153 --> 00:10:53.553
When I was little, I was
afraid of the dark...

00:10:53.622 --> 00:10:56.090
...so I would often look up
to watch the stars by myself.

00:10:57.092 --> 00:11:00.528
When Shurei was with us, I
looked forward to the night.

00:11:01.363 --> 00:11:04.355
Every night, Shurei
would tell me stories.

00:11:05.668 --> 00:11:07.636
What kind of stories did she tell?

00:11:08.604 --> 00:11:10.572
The story of The Rose Princess.

00:11:11.774 --> 00:11:13.969
Please continue where you
stopped with yesterday's story.

00:11:14.043 --> 00:11:15.874
You'll fall asleep in the
middle again, won't you?

00:11:15.945 --> 00:11:18.175
How many times must I
tell you the same story?

00:11:19.081 --> 00:11:21.049
Any number of times.

00:11:23.485 --> 00:11:24.975
Once upon a time...

00:11:25.054 --> 00:11:27.989
...there was a very beautiful
princess named the Rose Princess.

00:11:29.258 --> 00:11:33.558
She possessed the amazing ability
to heal any injury or illness.

00:11:34.396 --> 00:11:38.230
However, the Rose Princess was
kidnapped by a greedy master...

00:11:38.968 --> 00:11:40.936
...who wanted her abilities.

00:11:43.105 --> 00:11:45.073
The ability to control
the mysterious...

00:11:46.075 --> 00:11:48.373
Before long, the story of this princess...

00:11:49.745 --> 00:11:52.714
...with eternal beauty that
could even dim moonlight...

00:11:52.781 --> 00:11:54.271
...spread across the country.

00:11:58.187 --> 00:11:59.154
Men came in great numbers...

00:11:59.221 --> 00:12:00.745
...all wanting to propose
marriage to the princess.

00:12:01.623 --> 00:12:04.592
So the master decided to take
her where nobody would find her.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.366
The master gave her
whatever she desired.

00:12:17.039 --> 00:12:19.007
Except for her freedom.

00:12:25.748 --> 00:12:27.716
You did fall asleep!

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:29.917
I'm not asleep.

00:12:29.985 --> 00:12:31.680
What?! You're pretending
to be asleep?

00:12:34.656 --> 00:12:36.624
Go ahead. Continue.

00:12:38.494 --> 00:12:42.555
Time passed. And one day, a man
appeared before the Rose Princess.

00:12:44.366 --> 00:12:47.494
The man jumped over
the many fences...

00:12:47.569 --> 00:12:49.264
...that encircled her
to get to where she was.

00:12:50.406 --> 00:12:52.874
He fell in love with the
princess at first sight.

00:12:53.809 --> 00:12:55.743
Even though he had in fact
come to kill the princess...

00:12:55.811 --> 00:12:58.279
...for she was disturbing
the country's peace.

00:12:59.848 --> 00:13:04.182
Taking the princess, the man
fled as far away as he could.

00:13:05.788 --> 00:13:09.554
Over time, the Rose Princess had
lost those special abilities...

00:13:10.059 --> 00:13:11.993
...but the man did not mind.

00:13:12.061 --> 00:13:16.157
Mother, did the Rose Princess
live happily after that?

00:13:16.999 --> 00:13:20.366
She sure did. The princess gave
birth to a lovely little girl.

00:13:21.503 --> 00:13:23.937
However that little girl
had fallen to sickness.

00:13:24.907 --> 00:13:28.502
But she became aware that she
would be able to have one wish...

00:13:28.577 --> 00:13:30.545
...in exchange for her own life.

00:13:31.547 --> 00:13:33.515
The Rose Princess did not hesitate.

00:13:34.116 --> 00:13:36.414
"I will turn back into an ordinary rose...

00:13:37.186 --> 00:13:41.350
...but my heart will belong
to you through eternity."

00:13:43.358 --> 00:13:47.954
So the rose grew thorns, so that
it would never be captured again.

00:13:49.131 --> 00:13:53.033
The rose's thorns are proof of
the Rose Princess' love, right?

00:13:55.037 --> 00:13:58.097
I don't want to become that master
who knew only to confine her.

00:13:59.475 --> 00:14:01.636
On the other hand, I cannot
throw away everything...

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:03.678
...and flee with the
Rose Princess, either.

00:14:07.516 --> 00:14:09.984
But still, if I could remain the
man who loved the Rose Princess...

00:14:10.352 --> 00:14:12.343
...and was loved by her in return...!

00:14:13.956 --> 00:14:18.120
I don't have mysterious powers
like the Rose Princess...

00:14:18.994 --> 00:14:20.962
...and I'm not beautiful.

00:14:21.396 --> 00:14:24.888
But perhaps I do have... thorns.

00:14:30.572 --> 00:14:33.473
So that no one can capture you?

00:14:47.089 --> 00:14:52.049
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:14:59.635 --> 00:15:02.263
What did you say?!
They've left for Koren?!

00:15:02.704 --> 00:15:06.196
They left early yesterday morning.
When I asked to have them contacted...

00:15:06.575 --> 00:15:09.009
...that's what I was told by the
castle's government official.

00:15:09.311 --> 00:15:11.279
It appears that we just
missed each other.

00:15:12.414 --> 00:15:15.542
Then the merchant rumors we
heard en route were true.

00:15:16.318 --> 00:15:18.286
Koren is under a blockade.

00:15:19.388 --> 00:15:20.355
Damn!

00:15:20.422 --> 00:15:24.882
If only we'd anticipated the actions
of Shurei's group and gone to Koren!

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:28.090
The fact that they headed for Koren as
soon as they heard of the blockade...

00:15:28.564 --> 00:15:30.555
...shows some quick action on
their part, which is good.

00:15:30.632 --> 00:15:33.328
Not to mention they seem to be
working hard of their own volition.

00:15:33.402 --> 00:15:35.370
Both Shurei and Eigetsu.

00:15:35.938 --> 00:15:38.406
In addition, I hear that they
banished the Murderous Blades...

00:15:38.473 --> 00:15:40.703
...the gangsters that had
taken control of the city...

00:15:40.776 --> 00:15:43.745
...and freed the Mayor of Kinka,
who had been placed in confinement.

00:15:44.179 --> 00:15:45.578
Oh?

00:15:45.647 --> 00:15:49.447
Sure Seiran and Ensei are with them,
but even so, that's quite impressive.

00:15:51.019 --> 00:15:53.044
Yes, an impressive near miss.

00:15:57.459 --> 00:16:01.259
I can't even get a glimpse
of Shurei from afar.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:05.999
It appears that monster
is planning to take...

00:16:06.068 --> 00:16:08.298
...the position of
head of the Sa Clan...

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:10.463
...for himself and
make Shurei his wife.

00:16:11.406 --> 00:16:13.431
Apparently he is in Koren as well.

00:16:14.109 --> 00:16:16.077
Shall we head there too?

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:19.008
The woman you love...

00:16:19.081 --> 00:16:21.606
...who gives you 1000 years' worth
of thoughts in a single day...

00:16:21.683 --> 00:16:23.617
...is just a short distance from you.

00:16:23.685 --> 00:16:25.653
Although it's a pathetic
move as a king...

00:16:26.188 --> 00:16:29.487
...as a man, at times it's all
right to do foolish things.

00:16:31.326 --> 00:16:32.418
Shuei!

00:16:33.862 --> 00:16:34.692
Though it's much more troublesome...

00:16:34.763 --> 00:16:36.822
...for the people serving
under a foolish king.

00:16:37.599 --> 00:16:39.464
Stop calling me foolish.

00:16:40.402 --> 00:16:43.462
By the way, Advisor Sho is
in Sa Province too, isn't he?

00:16:43.538 --> 00:16:46.598
There's absolutely no need to
worry about that old badger!

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:52.911
Lady Eiki.

00:16:54.516 --> 00:16:58.680
Advisor Sho has arrived and says
that he would like to meet with you.

00:17:00.222 --> 00:17:03.953
So he's finally here. Much too late!

00:17:05.661 --> 00:17:06.685
Let him in.

00:17:06.762 --> 00:17:07.888
Yes.

00:17:08.964 --> 00:17:11.194
I never liked that man...

00:17:11.667 --> 00:17:15.569
...and I imagine he's still proceeding
along the path of the sly beast-monster.

00:17:30.018 --> 00:17:31.485
Whoa!

00:17:38.226 --> 00:17:40.194
So that's Koren.

00:17:43.865 --> 00:17:44.832
How did it look?

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:49.530
Soldiers of the Sa Clan are waiting
to ambush us ahead. My dear Sho Sai!

00:17:51.206 --> 00:17:52.195
What is it?

00:17:52.341 --> 00:17:53.433
Take over the carriage.

00:17:53.508 --> 00:17:55.100
Seiran and I will head there first...

00:17:55.177 --> 00:17:57.338
...and defeat those guys so
we can open up the route.

00:17:57.412 --> 00:17:59.937
I don't know if we'll be
able to defeat them all.

00:18:00.482 --> 00:18:00.880
So?

00:18:00.982 --> 00:18:02.847
After I give the signal...

00:18:02.918 --> 00:18:04.886
...go full speed ahead on the road.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:07.110
While I always hold a basic principle...

00:18:07.189 --> 00:18:10.386
...of only using eighty
percent of my power...

00:18:11.293 --> 00:18:12.851
...this will have to be an exception.

00:18:12.928 --> 00:18:13.895
We're counting on you.

00:18:14.896 --> 00:18:16.864
Well then, let's go!

00:18:18.867 --> 00:18:20.630
Both of you, be careful!

00:18:33.181 --> 00:18:36.878
Let me make this clear. Unlike
you, I'm a civil official!

00:18:37.252 --> 00:18:39.413
Well sure, but putting
your swordsmanship aside...

00:18:39.488 --> 00:18:42.480
...you are trained in horsemanship,
right. By that person.

00:18:45.894 --> 00:18:48.362
As you can see, the road
suddenly gets wider here.

00:18:49.264 --> 00:18:52.427
Then we reach the end of the cliff,
and it's a forest from here.

00:18:52.734 --> 00:18:55.726
If they're going to attack,
it will definitely be here.

00:18:56.204 --> 00:18:57.262
You're right.

00:18:57.339 --> 00:18:59.807
If we can get past here,
then we've reached Koren.

00:19:00.175 --> 00:19:01.437
Right.

00:19:09.351 --> 00:19:10.648
They're late.

00:19:10.719 --> 00:19:11.708
We thought so too.

00:19:11.787 --> 00:19:13.755
So we went out of our
way to come to you.

00:19:43.084 --> 00:19:44.551
There certainly are
a lot of them!

00:19:44.619 --> 00:19:45.449
Yeah.

00:19:55.564 --> 00:19:57.395
Seiran! Behind you!

00:20:07.175 --> 00:20:09.143
You're kidding me! Really?!

00:20:15.317 --> 00:20:17.285
Don't make it easy for them! Attack!

00:20:28.196 --> 00:20:29.754
Impressive.

00:20:37.239 --> 00:20:39.104
I can't believe you
came all the way here.

00:20:39.174 --> 00:20:43.508
I'm sorry. But now, we can
swing these swords together!

00:20:53.388 --> 00:20:55.356
Now's the time.

00:20:58.894 --> 00:20:59.690
It's the signal!

00:20:59.895 --> 00:21:01.089
Let's go!

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:05.457
Why, that's...!

00:21:05.534 --> 00:21:06.501
Damn!

00:21:06.568 --> 00:21:07.227
Nope!

00:21:07.702 --> 00:21:08.498
Shurei?!

00:21:10.639 --> 00:21:11.503
Don't let your guard down!

00:21:11.606 --> 00:21:12.368
R-Right!

00:21:38.366 --> 00:21:41.028
Shurei! It's dangerous
to stick your face out!

00:21:41.303 --> 00:21:43.271
Ah, right.

00:21:49.611 --> 00:21:51.579
Shurei.

00:21:53.481 --> 00:21:54.948
What the...!

00:21:57.953 --> 00:22:00.615
W-Well, about me coming here...!

00:22:01.156 --> 00:22:03.181
We won't say a word
to Princess about it.

00:22:04.693 --> 00:22:09.062
Thank you. I'll leave the rest to you.

00:22:12.767 --> 00:22:13.927
Well, shall we go?

00:22:14.002 --> 00:22:15.230
Yeah

00:22:25.714 --> 00:22:27.682
We should be returning.

00:22:28.149 --> 00:22:29.616
Yes.

00:22:31.686 --> 00:22:33.779
The nights will be long again.

00:22:34.723 --> 00:22:38.523
If you'd like, I could
tell you a bedtime story.

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:41.128
Stop it!!

00:22:41.596 --> 00:22:43.996
What's going on inside your head?!

00:22:44.432 --> 00:22:47.401
You know, I suggest that
you try and have more fun!

00:22:47.469 --> 00:22:50.529
Have fun at what? What are
you implying I should enjoy?

00:22:51.139 --> 00:22:54.040
Am I unable to even
touch the rose?

00:23:03.318 --> 00:23:06.412
Governor Hong's group should
be arriving any moment now.

00:23:21.069 --> 00:23:23.037
That's Koren.

00:23:30.612 --> 00:23:35.709
You've always led a very
carefree life and right now

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:42.414
Amidst this rain what sort
of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.524 --> 00:23:47.587
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.696 --> 00:23:52.690
You must be holding
back the tears too

00:23:53.768 --> 00:23:58.228
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.774 --> 00:24:04.905
You are just like me

00:24:05.647 --> 00:24:10.175
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.251 --> 00:24:16.156
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.125 --> 00:24:22.927
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:23.031 --> 00:24:27.900
I will always think of you

00:24:29.037 --> 00:24:41.711
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.120 --> 00:24:45.954
Next Episode

00:24:45.954 --> 00:24:48.389
Next Episode
We've come all the way here to the
capital of Sa Province, Koren!

00:24:48.389 --> 00:24:48.990
Next Episode
Women Are Brave

00:24:48.990 --> 00:24:51.326
Next Episode
Women Are Brave
It may be blockaded in accordance
to the orders of the Sa Clan...

00:24:51.326 --> 00:24:51.359
Next Episode
Women Are Brave

00:24:51.359 --> 00:24:53.061
Next Episode
Women Are Brave
...but we're not gonna
turn around and leave!

00:24:53.061 --> 00:24:53.094
Next Episode
Women Are Brave

00:24:53.094 --> 00:24:54.462
Next Episode
Women Are Brave
All right, Seiran, Ensei!

00:24:54.629 --> 00:24:56.859
Let's enter Koren... carefully!
